    "message": "fix(engine): validate discard choices and empty-library explore\n\nPreserve failed produced-token attempt01. Reject ineligible or duplicate chosen discard costs before movement; apply existing counter placement to empty-library explore; correct Map YesNo fixtures without changing assertions. Bind prospectively reviewed focused20/card154 and required VOW/LCI Assay diagnostics. No pilot, deck, protocol, claim or gameplay authority change.",
